          "Low pH (<5.5), poor growth",
          "Acid soil",
          "Apply dolomite lime to target pH"
        ],
        [
          "High pH (>7.5), iron chlorosis",
          "Calcareous soil",
          "Acidify; use chelated micronutrients; use tolerant rootstocks"
        ]
